      "text": [
        "Getting to know Cocoon",
        "SwipeCapability",
        "Choose a therapist simply by swiping left and right. Once you swipe right, you have the option to contact a therapist directly to set up a consultation.",
        "Customizable Preferences",
        "Our custom demographic search function will tailor the search of a therapist to your specific background, lived experience and mental health needs.We will find someone who gets you. We will always have your back!",
        "TherapyType",
        "You can find your desired form of therapy, among a variety of disciplines including Cognitive Behavioural Therapy, dynamic therapy, psycho-somatic therapy, Internal Family Systems, EMDR and many more.",
        "Kindnessfirst",
        "No matter your race, religion, ethnicity, ability, size, sex, gender identity, or sexual orientation, you are always welcome on this platform. We will never discriminate and we will always put kindness first.",
        "Convenience",
        "You choose what works for you: in person therapy, remote therapy or hybrid. We will always do our best to accommodate your preferences."
      ]
    },
